    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42283" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείπ-ιον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fallen ruin, wreck,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1413a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				49(25).42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.324
			</span></i>: generally in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτικὰ ἐ.</span>”
				<i>wreckage,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					660
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				274
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1080
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θραύμασίν τ᾽ ἐρειπίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					425
				</span></i>
			; <i>ruins,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκημάτων,</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχέων</span>], <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.154
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.124
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείπια</span> alone, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς Κιμωνίοις ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					151
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. χλανιδίων</span>
			<i>fragments</i> of garments, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1025
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκρῶν ἐ.</span>”
				<i>dead carcasses,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				266
			</span></i>.—Poet.and later Prose (exc. Arist.and Hdt.ll.cc.),
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.14
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2700e
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				10.38.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
			</span></i> l.c., etc.</div>
